  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-crafting-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Crafting-Tables\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieon-studios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-los-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>Добавляем остальные варианты верстаков в игру!</h3>\n<p>Сделайте процесс создания предметов ярким с помощью различных пород дерева! Теперь у каждого типа древесины есть свой собственный верстак. Позвольте вашему верстаку стать украшением постройки, а не просто последним дубовым блоком.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/More-Crafting-Tables/main/img/vanillaTables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>Добавляем 10 новых сундуков в Minecraft максимально ванильным способом.</h3>\n<p>Благодаря поддержке Quad добавлено:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Верстаки можно использовать как топливо в печи (за исключением древесины Нижнего мира)</li>\n<li>Верстаки из древесины Нижнего мира не горят и не плавятся от лавы</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
